    <div class="corner tl"></div>
    <div class="corner tr"></div>
    <div class="corner bl"></div>
    <div class="corner br"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-exif">
    1/2000s <span>·</span> f/2.8 <span>·</span> ISO 200<br>
    <span>RF 70-200MM</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Sports &amp; Automotive Photography</div>
    <h1>Freeze the<br>moment.</h1>
    <p>Platform tennis, motorsport, and the moments in between — shot around Penn State and beyond. Available for team coverage, car meets, and event work.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#contact">Book a shoot</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#tennis">View galleries</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="about-label">About</div>
      <h3>Shot by a civil engineering student who never puts the camera down.</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="about-body">
      <p><strong>I'm Will</strong> — a Civil Engineering student at Penn State who shoots sports, cars, and whatever else is fast and worth freezing in a frame. What started with a Canon R6 turned into covering platform tennis at competitive levels and chasing down local car meets.</p>
      <p>I care about the same thing an engineer cares about: getting the details right. Sharp focus, clean light, and images you'd actually want to hand to a client — not just post.</p>
      <p>Currently shooting with a Canon EOS R6 and RF 70-200mm f/2.8, available for team photography, event coverage, and automotive shoots in the State College area.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

